# Intentionally empty.
#
# The TB710FU product build.prop now bakes every persistent switch this module
# used to force:
#   persist.sys.gesture_wakeup=2
#   persist.sys.device_case_enabled=1
#   persist.sys.high_touch_sampling_rate.enable=1
#   persist.sys.stylus.enable=1
#   persist.miui.extm.enable=1
#   ro.product.marketname=联想小新平板Pro GT
#
# A KSU system.prop is applied with resetprop on every boot, which would
# overwrite the user's Settings choice (e.g. turning double-tap wake off would
# not survive a reboot).  The build.prop values are only first-boot defaults;
# persistent_properties in /data then owns them.  Keep this file comment-only so
# an in-place module upgrade also replaces the old prop file.
